WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.530
Urartu, Biainili to its kings,

2
00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:07.822
ruled these highlands
from Tushpa, by Lake Van.

3
00:00:07.862 --> 00:00:10.232
Its citadel crowned the Rock of Van,

4
00:00:10.272 --> 00:00:14.409
a long, narrow ridge
that rises steeply from the plain.

5
00:00:14.769 --> 00:00:17.499
By the middle
of the eighth century BC,

6
00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:20.007
Sarduri II held the throne.

7
00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:24.091
Then Tiglath-pileser III
took the Assyrian throne.

8
00:00:24.131 --> 00:00:27.941
In 743 BC, by the Euphrates,

9
00:00:27.981 --> 00:00:30.415
he broke Sarduri and his allies.

10
00:00:30.775 --> 00:00:34.445
Eight years later, in 735 BC,

11
00:00:34.485 --> 00:00:37.231
he marched
into the heart of Biainili.

12
00:00:37.271 --> 00:00:40.541
His inscriptions say
he shut Sarduri up in Tushpa

13
00:00:40.581 --> 00:00:43.505
and defeated him
before the city gates.

14
00:00:43.865 --> 00:00:46.595
Yet they do not claim
that the citadel fell,

15
00:00:46.635 --> 00:00:48.292
and it did not.

16
00:00:48.332 --> 00:00:52.015
Now Assyrian spears fill
the vale below the rock.

17
00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:55.524
Hold the royal road.

